    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/cultural-festival/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Cultural Festival is a versatile and visually captivating theme designed to showcase a wide array of festivals, including music festivals, film festivals, art festivals, food festivals, wine events, cultural celebrations, exhibitions, conferences, gatherings, conventions, summits, fairs, workshops, seminars, expos, forums, meetups, banquets, retreats, and arts-related events. This theme is perfect for creating stunning websites for various types of festivals, from local community events to international and traditional festivals. Featuring a clean and modern layout, the Cultural Festival Theme offers an intuitive design that highlights festival events, activities, schedules, and performer lineups. Built with Elementor, it provides drag-and-drop customization with ease, enabling organizers to tailor sections without any coding. Its responsive design ensures a seamless experience across all devices, making it easy for festival-goers to access information on the go. The theme includes customizable sections for tickets, passes, admission details, and festival attractions like food trucks, craft vendors, and live performances. With integrated marketing and promotional tools such as social media integration, sponsorship display, partnership features, and volunteer coordination, this theme is ideal for any event planning website focused on cultural festivals and large-scale public events."
    },
